{"link":{"rel":"self","url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/item/67febb3cd4be02350c2609bc"},"relatedItems":{"link":{"url":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/itemLinks?itemId=67febb3cd4be02350c2609bc","rel":"related"}},"id":"67febb3cd4be02350c2609bc","identifiers":[{"type":"DOI","scheme":"https://www.sciencebase.gov/vocab/category/item/identifier","key":"doi:10.5066/P13HTKV3"}],"title":"Minerals Yearbook, volume III, Area Reports — International: 2019 country chapters, table 1, production of mineral commodities","summary":"This data release contains the compilation of country level mineral commodity production data extracted from Table 1 within all published 2019 international chapters in the U.S. Geological Survey's annual publication Minerals Yearbook Volume III: Area Reports — International. Individual Minerals Yearbook country chapters are published independently from the complete volume as \"Advanced Release.\" Data reported in Table 1 of the individual country chapters include mineral commodity production data over a 5-year period (2015 through 2019). For this data release, these mineral commodity production data from all published 2019 international chapters were combined into a single table and reformatted into a machine-readable format .csv file. [...]","body":"This data release contains the compilation of country level mineral commodity production data extracted from Table 1 within all published 2019 international chapters in the U.S. Geological Survey's annual publication Minerals Yearbook Volume III: Area Reports — International. Individual Minerals Yearbook country chapters are published independently from the complete volume as \"Advanced Release.\" Data reported in Table 1 of the individual country chapters include mineral commodity production data over a 5-year period (2015 through 2019). For this data release, these mineral commodity production data from all published 2019 international chapters were combined into a single table and reformatted into a machine-readable format .csv file. No content from the originally published tables were modified or revised in this process other than minor typographical errors.","citation":"National Minerals Information Center (NMIC), 2025, Minerals Yearbook, volume III, Area Reports — International: 2019 country chapters, table 1, production of mineral commodities: U.S. Geological Survey data release, https://doi.org/10.5066/P13HTKV3.","purpose":"Published on an annual basis, the U.S. Geological Survey's Minerals Yearbook Volume III: Area Reports — International is the Government's publication to furnish information covering mineral commodities in various countries. Individual Minerals Yearbook country chapters include sections on government policies and programs, trade and production data, industry structure and ownership, commodity sector developments, infrastructure, and a summary outlook. Data tables within these chapters contain mineral commodity information and statistics over a range of 5 years covering over 90 individual minerals and materials. The purpose of this data release is to provide mineral commodity production data from these tables into a machine-readable format.","rights":"This work is marked with Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The U.S. Geological Survey (USGS) provides these geographic data \"as is.\" Unless otherwise stated, all data, metadata and related materials are considered to satisfy the quality standards relative to the purpose for which the data were collected. Although these data and associated metadata have been processed successfully on USGS computer systems, reviewed for accuracy and completeness, and approved for release by the USGS, no warranty expressed or implied is made regarding the display or utility of the data on any other system or for general or scientific purposes, nor shall the act of distribution constitute any such warranty. The burden for determining fitness for use of these data lies entirely with the user. Users are advised to read the dataset's metadata thoroughly to understand appropriate use and data limitations.","provenance":{"dateCreated":"2025-04-15T20:02:04Z","lastUpdated":"2026-02-25T00:08:41Z"},"maintenanceUpdateFrequency":"None planned","hasChildren":false,"parentId":"5c8c03e4e4b0938824529f7d","contacts":[{"name":"National Minerals Information Center","type":"Originator","contactType":"organization","onlineResource":"https://www.usgs.gov/centers/national-minerals-information-center","email":"nmicrecordsmgt@usgs.gov","organization":{},"primaryLocation":{"officePhone":"703-648-4976","faxPhone":"703-648-4995","streetAddress":{"line1":"12201 Sunrise Valley Drive","city":"Reston","state":"Virginia","zip":"20192","country":"US"},"mailAddress":{}}},{"name":"National Minerals Information Center","type":"Point of Contact","contactType":"organization","onlineResource":"https://www.usgs.gov/centers/national-minerals-information-center","email":"nmicrecordsmgt@usgs.gov","organization":{"displayText":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"primaryLocation":{"officePhone":"703-648-4976","faxPhone":"703-648-4995","streetAddress":{"line1":"12201 Sunrise Valley Drive","city":"Reston","state":"Virginia","zip":"20192","country":"US"},"mailAddress":{}}},{"name":"National Minerals Information Center","type":"Metadata Contact","contactType":"organization","onlineResource":"https://www.usgs.gov/centers/national-minerals-information-center","email":"nmicrecordsmgt@usgs.gov","active":true,"organization":{},"primaryLocation":{"officePhone":"703-648-4976","faxPhone":"703-648-4995","streetAddress":{"line1":"12201 Sunrise Valley Drive","city":"Reston","state":"Viriginia","zip":"20192","country":"US"},"mailAddress":{}}},{"name":"U.S. Geological Survey","oldPartyId":18139,"type":"Publisher","contactType":"organization","onlineResource":"http://www.usgs.gov/","active":true,"aliases":["{\"name\":\"USGS\"}","{\"name\":\"Geological Survey (U.S.)\"}","{\"nam